### Endpoint Hola mundo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000

### probar suma
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/suma?num1=100&num2=15

### probar suma2
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/suma
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1": 50,
    "num2": 30
}

### probar multiplicar
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/multiplicar
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1": 50,
    "num2": 30
}

### probar dividir
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/dividir
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1": 50,
    "num2": 30
}